<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon Co started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Raytheon Co started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers analyst Joseph Campbell started coverage of Raytheon Co Friday with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- Merger-and-acquisition uncertainties &quot;will be resolved within the next six months, while management succession issues should be clarified in the next 12 months,&quot; he wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Lexington, Mass., missile and defense electronics company were up 1/4 to 53-1/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
